ial equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=-{e}^{x},\\,q(x)={x}^{2},\\,n=5.\n$$\n\n- Equation ${y}^{′}+{y}^{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=-x{y}^{3}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${y}^{′}-{e}^{x}y={x}^{2}{y}^{5}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244193 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4188ff28-f5eb-597b-bef2-216186195b37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461509} {:answer/id #uuid "8c7a7e04-5442-58d1-a701-5ba3498e1a2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461510}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4188ff28-f5eb-597b-bef2-216186195b37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461509} :answer-field/id #uuid "37ec752f-54aa-5e7c-9129-479813fba7dd" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}+\\sqrt{x}y={x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462508} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "161adb6f-f3ba-5dde-82d7-642b483bc333" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461511} {:answer/id #uuid "e5f7c94e-4761-585a-a104-0f0a769debd8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461512}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "161adb6f-f3ba-5dde-82d7-642b483bc333" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461511} :answer-field/id #uuid "d2f3c6c8-b230-571d-b71c-668aa2d5950b" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}{y}^{2}=x{y}^{3}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-